## 👩‍💻 My Contributions *(Azra Bano)*

- 🧠 **Full-Stack Development**: Integrated GeminiAI API endpoints and implemented front-end UI.
- 📚 **Medical Research Alignment**: Ensured outputs aligned with official OSCE scoring rubrics.
- 🔄 **LinkedList Token Segmentation**: Engineered a dynamic splitting method to bypass token limits while preserving logic.
- 🎤 **Demo & Judging**: Led technical explanation and walkthrough during final judging session.

